5,1,1,talk,Mio,,"Hi everyone! I'm so excited for the training camp! To get us started, I want to make sure we're being fair with the budget. Let's figure out where we should go!","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Shizue,,"It is wonderful to see your enthusiasm, Mio. I agree, we should choose a place where everyone feels welcome and can truly bond. I look forward to hearing everyone's ideas.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,"We should be practical. Before we get carried away with ideas, we need to understand the logistical constraints and the workload involved in organizing this. Let's look at the data first.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Rin,,I agree with Ryuji! Let's find some cool clues first! I want to know if we can do something adventurous this year. What do you guys think we should check first?,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Misaki,,I agree with Ryuji. We need a clear picture of the costs and logistics before we decide on a destination. Let's start by examining the available data to avoid any surprises.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Mio,,"I'm with you, Ryuji! Let's be practical. I want to see the ""Group transport in three years of receipts"" and ""Quoting terms for whole-building lets"" to see how the money actually works!","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"I think it would be lovely to see ""What the seniors say about year-groups mixing"" and the ""Attendance sheets for the away camps."" It is important that everyone feels included and happy to join us.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"I'll look into the ""Canteen closure and last year's cooking duty"" and the ""Lottery and application for public group bookings."" We need to ensure the administrative burden is manageable for whoever organizes this.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Rin,,"I want to know about the ""Accounts from two clubs that went inland"" and the ""Prefecture rate sheet for publicly run beds""! I bet inland places have the best adventures!","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Misaki,,"I'll check the ""Group transport in three years of receipts"" and the ""Quoting terms for whole-building lets."" I want to be absolutely certain about the actual expenses before we commit to any specific budget.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Mio,,"Since Misaki is checking the same things as me, maybe we can compare notes later! I'm really curious if the costs have been consistent over the years. Does anyone else have a specific place in mind?","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Shizue,,"I don't have a specific place in mind yet, dear. I simply hope we choose a destination that encourages the younger members to mingle and make wonderful memories together.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,It's too early to suggest a destination. We first need to see if the public bookings are even feasible and how much labor the cooking duties require. We can't ignore the human cost of the planning.,"{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Rin,,"@Ryuji, you're always so serious! But I want to know if the beds are comfy and if the inland clubs had fun. If we're going to be there for days, we need to feel great!","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Misaki,,"@Mio, yes, comparing notes will be useful. I want to ensure we aren't overlooking any hidden costs that could lead to a deficit. Let's wait for the data before we start suggesting locations.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Mio,,Sounds like a plan! I'll stick with my choices then. I can't wait to see what we find out! Let's all do our research and meet back here to share the results!,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Shizue,,I agree. Let us all take a moment to look into these things carefully. I hope the information we find helps us create a warm and inclusive atmosphere for everyone. See you all soon.,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Ryuji,,I agree. Let's proceed with the research. I will focus on the administrative and labor aspects to ensure the workload is distributed fairly and doesn't overwhelm any single person. I'll see you all in the next round.,"{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Rin,,"I'm ready! I'll go hunt for those clues right now! I hope the inland places have something super exciting for us to do! See you all soon, bye-bye!","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Misaki,,I'll begin my research now. I want to make sure we have a precise understanding of the financial history and the terms of the lets. I'll see you all in the next round.,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
